The general conjecture [SS05, Conjecture 29] is false: G. Pochuev (2026) gave a
counterexample for Z/17 on three leaves, acknowledged on Michałek's
conjectures page.

- sturmfels_sullivant is now the negation, tagged research solved.
- Add variants.zmod_seventeen (the counterexample); keep variants.zmod_four as
  the open case.
- Restrict the variants to 0 < n, where compatibility preserves cardinality.
- Prove variants.zmod_three_not_two in the file instead of leaving a sorry.
- Say explicitly that the equivalence with the ideal-theoretic form is quoted
  from [Mic16, Section 2] and not proved here; fix the journal citations.

